{"max_tokens":16000,"messages":[{"content":[{"text":"<task>\nYou are the review lens `trade_boundaries`. Your instructions:\n\n# Trade boundaries\n\n## Purpose\n\nAn electrical estimator usually reads only the electrical description. This lens reads everything else: other trades'\ndescriptions, the boundary list (gränsdragningslista) if there is one, the AF's general provisions and the drawings.\nFind electrical duties placed on the electrical contractor there, and work that no trade clearly owns, then check the\ncalc for each.\n\n## Checklist\n\nAll items are taxonomy 8 (`trade_boundary`) unless noted; when the duty is clearly the contractor's and simply has no\npost, use `unpriced_requirement` (taxonomy 15).\n\n- Holes and penetrations: core drilling, chasing, and certified fire sealing of cable penetrations. Who does each, and\n  does the calc have hours for it under the stated conditions?\n- Demolition: removal of old installations, centrals, rising mains and disused cables, in apartments and common areas.\n- Site power and temporary lighting for all trades, for the whole build time, not just a set-up.\n- Electrical connection of other trades' equipment: fans, pumps, motors, controls, floor heating, towel rails, water\n  metering, lifts, doors and gates, kitchen appliances.\n- Low-voltage systems: door phones, access control, fire and smoke alarms, fibre, TV and data, EV charging.\n- Earthing and bonding of new pipes and metal parts after other trades replace them.\n- Making good after electrical work: filling, painting, tiling. Who restores surfaces?\n- The boundary list against the descriptions: rows that put work on the electrical contractor that its own\n  description never mentions, and rows that contradict a description.\n- Lines in other trades' documents that hand a task to the electrical contractor (for example, connection by the\n  electrical contractor). Search for them by trade and by equipment name.\n\n## What counts as material\n\nA boundary is material when the work it moves to the contractor is worth about 20 000 kr or more, or when it is open\nenough that a later dispute is likely. Quote the block that assigns the work (or that leaves it open) and say what the\ncalc has for it. If the calc covers it, it is not a finding.\n\n## Tools\n\nsearch_blocks across all documents, using the map's roles to target other trades' documents; read_blocks for context;\noutline to find boundary and general-provision chapters; calc_posts to check coverage; view_tile when a drawing shows\nequipment to be connected. End with submit_flags.\n\nTools open to this lens: calc_posts, catalog_search, outline, read_blocks, search_blocks, submit_flags, view_tile.\nYou have at most 8 turns. Search and read what you need, then call submit_flags once with every material finding (an empty list if there is none). Code checks every citation and quote before it accepts a finding.\n</task>\n<tender_map>\nThe map step's summary of the tender. It was written by a model from the same untrusted documents: use it to find your way, and check anything you rely on against the blocks.\n{\"building_type\":\"Flerbostadshus, stambyte (fyra plan ovan källare, tre trappuppgångar)\",\"contract_form\":\"ABT 06 med ändringar i AF (totalentreprenad för elarbetena)\",\"documents\":[{\"doc_id\":\"97f565d67c44\",\"revision\":\"1.0\",\"role\":\"AF\"},{\"doc_id\":\"50e612221e96\",\"revision\":\"1.0\",\"role\":\"drawing\"},{\"doc_id\":\"d2d45f8616e5\",\"revision\":\"1.0\",\"role\":\"teknisk beskrivning el\"}],\"documents_named_not_present\":[\"Anbudskalkylens mall (nämnd i AFB.31 som del av förfrågningsunderlaget; ingår inte i paketet som handling)\"],\"occupancy\":\"Bebodda lägenheter, arbete en trappuppgång i taget\",\"permit_date\":null,\"stage_plan\":\"Tre etapper, en trappuppgång i taget: etapp 1 trappuppgång A v. 10–17 2027, etapp 2 trappuppgång B v. 18–25 2027, etapp 3 trappuppgång C v. 33–40 2027 (uppehåll v. 26–32). Vite 15 000 kr per påbörjad veckas försening per etapp.\",\"stated_scope\":\"Elarbeten vid stambyte i flerbostadshus: nya stigarledningar i tre trappuppgångar, nya lägenhetscentraler med jordfelsbrytare och demontering av befintlig el i alla lägenheter. Därtill ny nödbelysning med centralbatteri i trapphusen (36 armaturer), förberedelse för sex laddplatser samt byggström, byggbelysning och tillfällig el till boende. Antalet lägenheter är motstridigt: AF anger 42, teknisk beskrivning 38.\"}\n</tender_map>\n<focus_questions>\n- AFC.371 (97f565-8b6618) lägger byggström och byggbelysning för samtliga entreprenörer samt tillfällig el till boende på elentreprenören – var är detta prissatt?\n- Totalentreprenad enligt ABT 06 (97f565-63a48f): projektering av stigarledningar, centraler och nödbelysning ligger på elentreprenören – finns projekteringstid i kalkylen?\n- Laddinfrastruktur (d2d45f-bbeb9b): vem står för schakt och återställning på gården för tomrören – el eller bygg? Ingen gränsdragningslista finns i paketet.\n- Demontering och bortforsling (d2d45f-4a1e51): ingår håltagning, brandtätning och återställning efter rivning av dosor och ledningar i bebodda lägenheter, eller ligger det hos stambytesentreprenören?\n- Anslutning till fastighetens huvudcentral (d2d45f-31c970): krävs ombyggnad av huvudcentralen eller kontakt med nätägaren, och vem bär det?\n</focus_questions>","type":"text"}],"role":"user"},{"content":[{"signature":"","thinking":"","type":"thinking"},{"caller":{"type":"direct"},"id":"toolu_01ESBcTt9sQJdVxWLHSKwd5T","input":{"query":"byggström byggbelysning tillfällig el"},"name":"search_blocks","type":"tool_use"},{"caller":{"type":"direct"},"id":"toolu_01JdZxzwRkSJawv1wJ1CE2ji","input":{"query":"håltagning brandtätning genomföring"},"name":"search_blocks","type":"tool_use"},{"caller":{"type":"direct"},"id":"toolu_011DVVjcvKrLh8ZXtmrHUVhd","input":{"query":"återställning lagning målning"},"name":"search_blocks","type":"tool_use"},{"caller":{"type":"direct"},"id":"toolu_011942p27hB84KbyFmk1RESt","inpu